        </area>
        <area aac="QLD_FA004" description="South Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-08T17:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T07:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-12T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough and southeasterly wind change will continue to move north across South Queensland Waters during the remainder of Sunday into Monday as a low in the Tasman Sea deepens and moves toward New Zealand. In the wake of the trough, a weak ridge will extend over South Queensland Waters for the next few days. The next trough may move offshore of the South East Queensland coast during Thursday.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
